  "<a>Strategic Plan and Committee Action Plans" => "<a>战略计划和委员会行动计划",
  "WSE 2018-2019 STRATEGIC PLAN" => "WSE 2018-2019战略计划",
  "INTRODUCTION" => "简介",
  "Word Service Education (WSE) was incorporated in 2013. In the relatively short span of time from incorporation until now, our association has grown and contributed to our field at an impressive pace. Official membership has topped 200, we represent over 15 countries and have held three successful international conferences. We have provided resources and training to people who do the important work of international credential assessment" => "文字服务教育（WSE）于2013年成立。从公司成立到现在，在相对较短的时间内，我们的协会以令人印象深刻的速度成长并为我们的领域做出了贡献。正式会员超过200人，代表15多个国家，成功举办了三届国际会议。我们为从事国际认证评估重要工作的人员提供了资源和培训",
  "In order to meet the needs of our membership and continue to contribute to the world community by doing work that supports the movement of people across borders for educational, commercial and personal reasons, we need to plan. In September 2017 we completed a comprehensive process that resulted in this plan that will set the strategic direction of the organization in the years ahead" => "为了满足会员国的需要，继续为国际社会作出贡献，我们需要制定计划，支持因教育、商业和个人原因而跨越国界的人员流动。2017年9月，我们完成了一个全面的过程，该计划将为本组织今后几年的战略方向确定方向",
  "PROCESS" => "过程",
  "The strategic planning process included the following" => "战略规划过程包括以下内容",
  "Stakeholder input and information gathering" => "利益相关者输入和信息收集",
  "In order to understand the needs and goals of the association members and to review the association’s position in the international education environment, we collected data. We surveyed the WSE membership, all current WSE leaders, and all candidates for elected WSE positions. We gathered data on the current state of our association, on our external environment, and the international education community in which our members do their work" => "为了了解协会成员的需求和目标，以及评估协会在国际教育环境中的地位，我们收集了数据。我们调查了WSE成员、所有现任WSE领导人以及所有当选WSE职位的候选人。我们收集了我们协会的现状、外部环境以及会员工作所在的国际教育界的数据",
  "Analysis of issues and trends by association leaders" => "协会领导人对问题和趋势的分析",
  "WSE leaders and leader candidates met for an all-day retreat as part of the third annual meeting in Rome. At the meeting we reviewed our mission and operational principles, financial condition and accomplishments. Leaders reviewed member survey results, committee priorities and issues facing the association. An environmental scan and SWOT (strengths, weaknesses, opportunities and threats) analysis provided a context for our future direction" => "作为在罗马举行的第三届年会的一部分，WSE领导人和领导人候选人举行了为期一天的静修活动。会上，我们回顾了我们的使命和业务原则、财务状况和成绩。领导们回顾了会员调查结果、委员会的优先事项和协会面临的问题。环境扫描和SWOT（优势、劣势、机遇和威胁）分析为我们未来的发展方向提供了背景",
  "AREAS OF FOCUS" => "重点领域",
  "After sifting through all the data, discussion and analysis, the group identified three major areas of focus. These, along with overarching goals, are" => "经过对所有数据的筛选、讨论和分析，小组确定了三个主要的重点领域。这些以及总体目标是",
  "By the end of 2019, have in place the Foundation Certificate and at least three subject-specific certificates to meet the needs of WSE members at all levels" => "到2019年底，建立基金会证书和至少三个学科证书，以满足各级WSE成员的需求",
  "Professional Development" => "专业发展",
  "By the end of 2019, offer a comprehensive package of professional development programs that supports WSE members at all levels" => "到2019年底，提供一套全面的专业发展计划，支持所有级别的WSE成员",
  "Finances" => "资助",
  "By the end of 2019, support the continued development of the Certificate Program, professional development and other programs, and maintain fiscal responsibility through a variety of revenue streams such as the annual conference, sponsorship, and program fees" => "到2019年底，支持证书项目、专业发展和其他项目的持续发展，通过年会、赞助和项目费用等多种收入来源维持财政责任",
  "COMMITTEE ACTION PLANS" => "委员会行动计划",
  "WSE standing and ad-hoc committees developed their annual action plans for 2018" => "WSE常设委员会和特设委员会制定了2018年年度行动计划",
  "Committee for Standards (CFS) – Chair, Rolf Lofstad" => "标准委员会（CFS）-主席，Rolf Lofstad",
  "The goals of the CFS are to" => "CFS的目标是",
  "Identify standards and best practices in the use of resources" => "确定资源使用的标准和最佳实践",
  "Continuously refine and improve our four documents" => "不断完善和完善我们的四个文件",
  "The definition of the profession;" => "职业的定义；",
  "Statement of Ethics;" => "道德声明；",
  "Common standards in the evaluation of international credentials;" => "评价国际证书的共同标准；",
  "Competency profile for credential evaluators." => "证书评估者的能力配置文件。",
  "Committee for Membership Outreach (CMO) – Chair, Jeremy Mixell" => "会员推广委员会（CMO）–主席，Jeremy Mixell",
  "The CMO will" => "CMO将",
  "Build membership outreach through" => "通过",
  "Creation of individual and institutional contact lists;" => "建立个人和机构联系人名单；",
  "Postcard or small brochure highlighting member benefits;" => "明信片或小册子，突出会员福利；",
  "Flyers and other messaging;" => "传单和其他信息；",
  "Development of membership goals by region;" => "按区域制定会员目标；",
  "Bi-annual membership reports." => "双年度会员报告。",
  "Committee for Resources for Members (RMC) – Chair, Christopher Adams" => "成员资源委员会（RMC）——主席，克里斯托弗·亚当斯",
  "Goals for the RMC include" => "RMC的目标包括",
  "Continuing and further developing WSE Talk;" => "继续并进一步发展WSE谈话；",
  "Promoting and evaluating the Member Benefit Program;" => "促进和评估会员福利计划；",
  "Creation of an interactive platform such as a listserv;" => "创建一个交互平台，如listserv；",
  "Creation of a country database." => "建立国家数据库。",
  "Committee for Professional Development (CPD) – Chair, Denise Benz" => "专业发展委员会（CPD）-主席，丹尼斯·奔驰",
  "In the coming year, the CPD will" => "在未来一年，国家警察署将",
  "Organize webinars;" => "组织网络研讨会；",
  "Work with the Certificate Committee to create professional development content;" => "与认证委员会合作，创造专业发展内容；",
  "Update and maintain the Compendium of Professional Development Activities (“the Compendium”) – a list conferences, training opportunities, and other professional development opportunities around the world, arranged geographically;" => "更新并维护《职业发展活动纲要》（“纲要”）——列出世界各地按地理位置排列的会议、培训机会和其他职业发展机会；",
  "Develop a plan for providing research opportunities for members." => "制定一个为会员提供研究机会的计划。",
  "Committee for Government and Finance (CGF) – Chair, Margit Schatzman." => "政府和财政委员会（CGF）——主席，Margit Schatzman。",
  "Management of by-laws changes;" => "章程变更管理；",
  "Oversight of orientation for new leaders in the association;" => "监督协会新领导人的入职培训；",
  "Budget;" => "预算；",
  "Standardized position descriptions for EB members;" => "EB会员的标准化职位描述；",
  "External review of finances." => "财务外部审查。",
  "Conference Committee (CC) 2018– Chair, Timothy Kell" => "2018年会议委员会（CC）-主席，Timothy Kell",
  "Choosing locations of the annual conferences;" => "选择年会地点；",
  "Identifying annual conference coordinators;" => "确定年度会议协调员；",
  "Planning the 2018 and 2019 conferences, including the conference script;" => "包括2018年会议和会议脚本；",
  "Developing a three-year conference planning calendar." => "制定为期三年的会议计划日历。",
  "Committee for Marketing and Communications (CMC) – Chair, Shereen Mir-Jabbar" => "营销和传播委员会（CMC）-主席，Shereen Mir Jabbar",
  "In 2018, the CMC will" => "2018年，中央军委将",
  "Develop communications lists for disseminating WSE information to members and non-members. Manage these lists (legal, storage, update and maintenance);" => "制定沟通清单，向会员和非会员传播WSE信息。管理这些清单（法律、存储、更新和维护）；",
  "Develop a marketing and communications calendar of activities, and collaborate with other committees in publicizing WSE events and activities;" => "制定市场营销和交流活动日程表，并与其他委员会合作宣传WSE活动和活动；",
  "Develop a marketing strategy for the annual conference;" => "为年会制定营销策略；",
  "Develop and maintain relationships with other higher education media to promote WSE;" => "发展和维护与其他高等教育媒体的关系，以促进WSE；",
  "Work with the Resources for Members Committee to develop a blog for members;" => "与会员资源委员会合作开发会员博客；",
  "Collaborate with other committees and the EB in creating member surveys to inform professional development content offerings;" => "与其他委员会和EB合作，创建会员调查，为专业发展内容提供信息；",
  "Develop an email list (with opt-out feature) for members." => "为会员开发电子邮件列表（带有退出功能）。",
  "Certificate Committee (CC) – Chair, Kate Trayte Freeman" => "证书委员会（CC）-主席，Kate Trayte Freeman",
  "The CC’s goals are" => "CC的目标是",
  "Maintain and expand Certificate offerings;" => "维护和扩展证书产品；",
  "Increase employer-recognition of WSE certificates." => "提高雇主对WSE证书的认可度。",
  "Organizational Advancement Committee (OAC) – Chair, George Kacenga" => "组织发展委员会（OAC）–主席，George Kacenga",
  "Over the course of 2018, the OAC will" => "在2018年期间，OAC将",
  "Draft and execute a fundraising strategy; prioritize fundraising objectives;" => "起草并执行筹款策略；优先考虑筹款目标；",
  "Establish a clear accounting of all donations and fundraising outcomes for WSE since its inception in 2013;" => "为WSE自2013年成立以来的所有捐赠和筹款结果建立清晰的账目；",
  "Collaborate with Marketing and Communications to draft strategic messaging for past and potential donors with the objective of securing sustainable streams of donor revenue." => "与营销和传播部门合作，为过去和潜在的捐助者起草战略信息，以确保捐助者收入的可持续来源。",
  "NEXT STEPS" => "下一步行动",
  "Managing performance:</b> Association leaders will set up systems of accountability and communication to ensure that goals are met and results are communicated to WSE members" => "管理绩效：</b>协会领导将建立责任制和沟通体系，以确保实现目标并将结果传达给WSE成员",
  "SUMMARY" => "摘要",
  "The strategic planning process was successful due to the active participation of WSE members and leaders. A great deal of thoughtful detail and input by members not included in this report, but nonetheless recorded and noted, will help to guide leaders in their work. Continued input and volunteer contributions by many members have and will continue to make WSE a successful association. The strategic plan will help us remain focused on the needs and wishes of membership." => "由于WSE成员和领导人的积极参与，战略规划过程取得了成功。本报告中没有包括但有记录和记录的成员提出的大量深思熟虑的细节和投入，将有助于指导领导人的工作。许多会员的持续投入和志愿者贡献已经并将继续使WSE成为一个成功的协会。战略计划将帮助我们继续关注会员国的需要和愿望。",
  "WSE will continue to serve its members as they contribute to the world community by doing work that supports the movement of people across borders for educational, commercial and personal reasons, building a stronger and better world" => "WSE将继续为其成员国服务，帮助他们为国际社会作出贡献，支持人们因教育、商业和个人原因而跨境流动，建设一个更强大、更美好的世界",
  "Notes:" => "笔记：",
  "Those attending the strategic planning retreat included current leaders and 2018 leader candidates (Board and Committee Chairs): Christopher Adams, Cloud Bai-Yun, Jeanie Bell, Denise Benz, LesLee Clauson Eicher, Kate Freeman, Diana Hense, Rolf Lofstad, Shereen Mir-Jabbar, Lou Nunes, Margit Schatzman, and Jessica Stannard" => "参加战略规划务虚会的包括现任领导人和2018年领导人候选人（董事会和委员会主席）：克里斯托弗·亚当斯、云朵白云、珍妮·贝尔、丹尼斯·本茨、莱斯利·克劳森·艾切尔、凯特·弗里曼、戴安娜·亨斯、罗尔夫·洛夫斯塔德、谢琳·米尔·贾巴尔、卢·努内斯、玛吉特·沙茨曼和杰西卡·斯坦纳德",
  "Leaders unable to attend, but who contributed to the preparation and success of the strategic planning process include David Haynes, Marshall Houserman, George Kacenga, Ken Warren, and Robert Prather (Executive Director)." => "未能出席，但为战略规划过程的准备和成功作出贡献的领导人包括大卫·海恩斯、马歇尔·豪斯曼、乔治·卡森加、肯·沃伦和罗伯特·普拉瑟（执行董事）。",
  "<a>Press Releases" => "<a>新闻稿",
  "May" => "五月",
  "COVID-19 Emergency Responses in Education: Possible Unintended Consequences" => "COVID-19教育应急响应：可能的意外后果",
  "In the history of global education, 2020 will go down as the year the coronavirus pandemic savaged education systems..." => "在全球教育史上，2020年将成为冠状病毒肆虐教育系统的一年。。。",
  "MORE" => "更多",
  "Perfect Storm: The Impact of the Coronavirus Crisis on International Student Mobility to the United States" => "完美风暴：冠状病毒危机对留学生赴美流动的影响",
  "The fallout from the COVID-19 pandemic for higher education institutions (HEIs) in the United States will likely be pronounced..." => "在美国高等教育机构（HEIs）的COVID-19大流行的后果可能会很明显。。。",
  "April" => "四月",
  "COVID-19 notice:" => "COVID-19通知：",
  "As of April 27th, 2020, the International Credential Evaluation Service (ICES) has made the online application available again and will be open to receiving..." => "截至2020年4月27日，国际证书评估服务（ICES）已再次提供在线申请，并将开放接受。。。",
  "February" => "二月",
  "Why the Blockchain will Revolutionize Academic Credentialing" => "为什么区块链将彻底改变学术认证",
  "This is a transcript of the presentation given during Educause at the Anaheim Convention Center on October 28, 2016..." => "这是2016年10月28日在阿纳海姆会议中心举行的Educause演讲的记录。。。",
  "March" => "三月",
  "Beyond Transcripts" => "超越成绩单",
  "For the last 100 years, a simple report called the academic transcript has operated as the official representation..." => "在过去的100年里，一份名为“学业成绩单”的简单报告一直是官方代表。。。",
  "Copy of application" => "申请书副本",
  "The certificate is missing or not enough, apply for more copies for use" => "证书丢失或不足，请申请更多副本以供使用",
  "In many cases, some employers or institutions need to keep your evaluation report, which will cause you to have no evaluation report available in the future, so WSE has opened a copy application service" => "在很多情况下，一些雇主或机构需要保留你的评估报告，这会导致你将来没有评估报告，所以WSE已经开通了一个副本申请服务",
  "To apply for a copy, you need to initiate an application with us and pay the corresponding cost, and we will send you a copy in a short time" => "要申请复印件，您需要向我们提出申请并支付相应的费用，我们会在短时间内给您发送一份副本",
  "WSE refuses to make a copy for you under the following circumstances" => "在下列情况下，WSE拒绝为您制作副本",
  "Users with false information submitted and blacklisted by WSE" => "提交虚假信息并被WSE列入黑名单的用户",
  "Your evaluation report has expired, please go to the help center to check the validity period of the WSE evaluation certificate" => "您的评估报告已过期，请前往帮助中心查看WSE评估证书的有效期",
  "When someone reports to the WSE that you use the assessment for illegal purposes" => "当有人向WSE报告您将评估用于非法目的时",
  "When frequently applying for a copy from WSE, WSE will consider it as having an illegal transaction assessment and also refuse to make a copy" => "当频繁地从WSE申请拷贝时，WSE会认为它具有非法事务评估，并且拒绝复制",
  "Other situations where WSE believes that it is not possible to make copies" => "WSE认为无法复制的其他情况",
  "Restrictions on copy application" => "复印申请限制",
  "In order to avoid the situation of illegal transaction evaluation, WSE has restricted the application of copies. If you really need a large number of evaluations due to special circumstances, please contact WSE customer service to apply" => "为了避免非法交易评估的情况，WSE限制了副本的应用。如因特殊情况确需大量评估，请联系WSE客服申请",
  "services and fees" => "服务和费用",
  "Degree Evaluation Education" => "学位教育评价",
