  "About American" => "关于美国人",
  "Choosing the USA" => "选择美国",
  "Why do so many international students choose U.S. colleges and universities?" => "为什么这么多留学生选择美国的学院和大学？",
  "USA State Guides" => "美国国家指南",
  "The United States is a complex and vast country made up of 50 states plus the city of Washington, D.C. - the nation’s capital - all of which have a distinct regional identity." => "美国是一个复杂而广阔的国家，由50个州加上首都华盛顿市组成，所有这些州都有着鲜明的地区特征。",
  "Application Process" => "申请流程",
  "International students often underestimate the amount of time required to apply for admission to a college or university in the United States." => "国际学生往往低估了申请美国大学或学院入学所需的时间。",
  "Financial Aid for the USA" => "对美国的财政援助",
  "Careful planning is both necessary and wise. You will be required to prove to the university, to the consular officer, and perhaps to the U.S. Customs and Border ...." => "周密的计划是必要的，也是明智的。你将被要求向大学证明，向领事官员证明，也许还需要向美国海关和边境局证明。。。。",
  "Preparation for Your Stay" => "准备入住",
  "Careful planning is one thing that you will have to do in order to make you time abroad a success." => "在国外，你要想成功，就得小心计划。",
  "The USA \"Way of Life\"" => "美国的“生活方式”",
  "If you are planning to live, learn and grow in the United States, you already possess a well-known American characteristic—a sense of adventure!" => "如果你打算在美国生活、学习和成长，你已经拥有了一种众所周知的美国特色——冒险精神！",
  "After Graduation" => "毕业后",
  "Congratulations on your Graduation! Now that you have completed your undergraduate degree program in the USA, you now have many options and avenues that you can ..." => "祝贺你毕业！现在你已经完成了你的本科学位课程在美国，你现在有很多选择和途径，你可以。。。",
  "Religious Schools in the US" => "美国的宗教学校",
  "Religion is an important factor for many international students coming to the United States." => "宗教是许多国际学生来美国的一个重要因素。",
  "Online Degree Programs" => "在线学位课程",
  "Online degrees are becoming a popular option for international students looking to advance their education." => "在线学位正成为希望提高教育水平的国际学生的热门选择。",
  "Guide to Getting into a US College or University" => "美国大学入学指南",
  "If you’ve decided you want to study in the United States next comes the hard part- the process of getting accepted." => "如果你决定要去美国留学，接下来的困难就是被录取的过程。",
  "Community Colleges in the US" => "美国社区学院",
  "Studying at a community college before transfering to a larger university has become a popular choice for international students in recent years." => "在转学到更大的大学之前先在社区学院学习，近年来已成为国际学生的热门选择。",
  "Our Blockchain Tools and Technologies" => "我们的区块链工具和技术",
