  "The public blockchain based on Ethereum is connected to the blockchain permanent storage certificate, from the school signer to each node data storage of the channel.The public blockchain based on Ethereum is connected to the blockchain permanent storage certificate, from the school signer to each node data storage of the channel." => "基于以太坊的公共区块链连接到区块链永久存储证书上，从学校签名者到每个节点的数据存储频道。那个基于以太坊的公共区块链连接到区块链永久存储证书上，从学校签署者到每个节点的数据存储通道。",
