  "General Instructions" => "一般说明",
  "Before starting this application, please make sure you have available scanned copies of all supporting document. We strongly recommend you download and complete our document checklist before starting this online application." => "在启动此应用程序之前，请确保您有所有支持文件的扫描副本。我们强烈建议您在启动此在线应用程序之前下载并完成我们的文档清单。",
  "Official Academic Record" => "正式学业成绩",
  "Your official academic record (transcript) must also be sent directly to our office. Official academic record (transcript) must be signed, stamped, and dated by the officials (i.e. Registrar, Controller of Examination) of the awarding institution. Official academic record (transcript) must be in a sealed institution envelope with an institution stamp, a seal, or a signature over the back flap." => "你的正式学习成绩（成绩单）也必须直接寄到我们办公室。正式成绩单（成绩单）必须由授予机构的官员（即注册主任、考试主管）签字、盖章并注明日期。正式学业成绩（成绩单）必须装在密封的学院信封内，信封背面盖有学校印章、印章或签名。",
  "It is your responsibility to make this arrangement. WSE cannot order these documents for applicants. Do not send us official academic record (transcript) prior to completing this application." => "你有责任做出这样的安排。WSE不能为申请人订购这些文件。在填写此申请表前，请勿将正式成绩单（成绩单）寄给我们。",
  "Service Standards:" => "服务标准：",
  "Our service delivery standard starts from the time that we have received and verified all documents related to your application. You will be notified by email when your application and supporting documents have been verified." => "我们的服务提供标准从我们收到并核实与您的申请相关的所有文件之时开始。当你的申请和证明文件被核实后，你会收到电子邮件通知。",
  "Payment:" => "付款：",
