  "First/Given Name" => "名/名",
  "Maiden /Former Name(s)" => "婚前/曾用名",
  "WSE will communicate with you primarily by email. For confidentiality, please ensure that this email address is used exclusively by yourself." => "WSE将主要通过电子邮件与您沟通。为保密起见，请确保此电子邮件地址仅供您本人使用。",
  "Intended Occupation" => "预定职业",
  "Valid Government-Issued ID" => "政府签发的有效身份证",
  "File Name" => "文件名",
  "One piece of valid government-issued identification (excluding health cards) showing date of birth is required to identify you as the rightful owner. If your name has changed since completing your studies, you must upload a copy of your proof of name change (e.g., marriage certificate) showing both your original and current name. All documents must be in English, French OR accompanied with official translations." => "您需要一份政府签发的有效身份证明（不包括健康卡），显示您的出生日期，以证明您是合法所有者。如果您的姓名在完成学业后发生了变化，您必须上传一份姓名变更证明（如结婚证书）的副本，同时显示您的原名和当前姓名。所有文件必须是英文、法文或附有官方翻译。",
