  "Scan both sides of each page of the original document (e.g., diploma, degree, certificate, academic records/transcripts)" => "扫描原始文件（如文凭、学位、证书、学习记录/成绩单）每一页的两面",
  "All documents not in English or French must be accompanied with official word-for-word translations." => "所有非英文或法文文件必须附有官方逐字翻译。",
  "Ensure all pages are clear and legible and that no information is cut off" => "确保所有页面清晰易读，没有信息被切断",
