  "You can view WSE's evaluation book, transcript and blockchain storage information evaluated based on your original file-information." => "您可以查看基于原始文件信息评估的WSE评估书、成绩单和区块链存储信息。",
  "Original File-Information Storage" => "原始文件信息存储",
  "You can view the transcripts, graduation certificates, identity documents, etc. provided when you apply for the service here." => "您可以在这里查看您申请服务时提供的成绩单、毕业证书、身份证明文件等。",
  "Electronic Certificate Sharing" => "电子证书共享",
