  "Translation-Notarization" => "翻译公证",
  "Here you can apply for evaluation certificates and achievement certificates in different languages according to different countries." => "在这里，您可以根据不同的国家申请不同语言的评估证书和成就证书。",
  "Query History" => "查询历史记录",
  "In order to ensure the security of your data, we have made a record of the inquirers of your evaluation certificate. You can view the inquiry record here." => "为确保您资料的安全，我们已对您的评估证明书查询者作了记录。您可以在这里查看查询记录。",
  "Original Document Verification" => "原始文件验证",
  "All your information is stored in the blockchain by WSE, and you can verify whether your information has been tampered with here." => "您的所有信息都由WSE存储在区块链中，您可以在这里验证您的信息是否被篡改。",
