  "Link validity period : 30 days" => "链接有效期：30天",
  "Specify Mailbox" => "指定邮箱",
  "Please enter the email address and we will send you the electronic file of the report." => "请输入电邮地址，我们会把报告的电子档寄给你。",
  "The recipient can view your file through the link. When viewing, the recipient needs to verify the mailbox to view the information, and will record the recipient's record of viewing your certificate in the <a class='color-blue' href='/certificate_query_logs.html' style='text-decoration: underline;'>verification history</a>." => "收件人可以通过链接查看您的文件。查看时，收件人需要验证邮箱才能查看信息，并将收件人查看证书的记录在<a class='color-blue'href='/certificate_query_logs.html'style='text-decoration:underline;'>验证历史记录</a>。",
  "We will send your documents to the recipients in the form of PDF or scanned copies stored by you. The recipients can view the file information directly in the mailbox, without the need to record the <a class='color-blue' href='/certificate_query_logs.html' style='text-decoration: underline;'>verification history</a>" => "我们将把您的文件以PDF格式或您存储的扫描副本发送给收件人。收件人可以直接在邮箱中查看文件信息，而无需记录验证历史记录",
  "In order to ensure the security of your personal information, please choose the appropriate sharing method to share your stored certificates to others." => "为了确保个人信息的安全，请选择适当的共享方法将存储的证书共享给其他人。",
  "I See" => "我了解了",
