  "The preview image of the certificate on the left is for language style reference only. The actual certificate needs to be checked and translated according to the content of different countries and different certificate requirements." => "左侧证书的预览图像仅供语言样式参考。实际证书需要根据不同国家的内容和不同的证书要求进行核对和翻译。",
