  "You should read the following agreement carefully before clicking on the consent process during the registration process. Please be sure to read and fully understand the terms of the agreement, including:" => "在注册过程中点击同意程序之前，您应该仔细阅读以下协议。请务必阅读并充分理解本协议的条款，包括：",
