  "If you have any questions about the agreement, you can consult the platform customer service." => "如果您对协议有任何疑问，可以咨询平台客服。",
  "Tip: When you follow the instructions on the registration page to fill out the information, read and agree to the agreement and complete all registration procedures, you have fully read, understood and accepted the entire contents of the agreement. If you have any disputes about the platform services, the Service Agreement will apply. If you are in dispute with other users during the use of Platform Services, they will be processed according to the agreement you have with other users." => "提示：当您按照注册页面上的说明填写信息、阅读并同意本协议并完成所有注册手续时，您已完全阅读、理解并接受本协议的全部内容。如果您对平台服务有任何争议，则以服务协议为准。如果您在使用平台服务过程中与其他用户发生争议，将根据您与其他用户达成的协议进行处理。",
  "In the process of reading the agreement, if you do not agree to the relevant agreement or any terms and conditions, you should immediately stop the registration process" => "在阅读协议的过程中，如果您不同意相关协议或任何条款和条件，您应立即停止注册过程",
