  "If you do not have your own student data management system or related network system, you can directly upload your student data on WSE. Due to the difference between the data uploaded by different universities, colleges and institutions, when you are sure to store When you need data, you need to contact us and submit an application plan. We will separately open a data upload plan for your data storage type." => "如果您没有自己的学生数据管理系统或相关网络系统，您可以直接在WSE上上传您的学生数据。由于不同院校和院校上传的数据存在差异，当您确定需要存储数据时，请联系我们并提交申请计划。我们将为您的数据存储类型单独打开一个数据上传计划。",
