  "1. Education promotion: When you have already submitted an application in WSE, and the application education you submitted does not match your current education, you want to update the latest education information, then you can choose the data update method of \"education improvement\"" => "1. 学历提升：当您已经在WSE中提交了申请，并且您提交的申请教育程度与您当前的教育程度不匹配时，您需要更新最新的教育信息，然后可以选择“学历提升”的数据更新方式",
  "2. Modification of current academic information: If you have just applied for WSE recently, but your information is submitted incorrectly due to negligence, and the information on your assessment report is also wrong, you can submit relevant information to update your data" => "2. 修改存储信息：如果您最近刚刚申请了WSE，但由于疏忽导致您的信息提交错误，并且您的评估报告中的信息也有错误，您可以提交相关信息以更新您的数据",
  "Both are suitable for different application requirements, please determine your data update requirements before choosing. You can decide which data update method to use according to your different needs" => "两者适用于不同的申请需求，请在选择之前确定您的数据更新需求，您可以根据不同的需求决定使用哪种数据更新方法",
