  "What is Records Keeper?" => "什么是 Records Keeper?",
  "A PROTOCOL FOR INTELLIGENT RECORD KEEPING & DATA SECURITY THROUGH BLOCKCHAIN" => "通过区块链实现智能记录保存和数据安全的协议",
  "Legally Acceptable & Verifiable Records" => "法律上可接受和可验证的记录",
  "Records Keeper is built for anyone who is looking to make their data more trustworthy through Blockchain-based records. Through Blockchain-verified records & information, it is integrity can be checked.." => "Records Keeper是为希望通过基于区块链的记录使其数据更可信的任何人而构建的。通过区块链验证的记录和信息，可以检查其完整性。。",
  "Immutable & Unmodifiable Records" => "不可变和不可修改的记录",
  "Once a record has been published, no one, not even the owner can change the records, only a chronological trail of modified records can be seen by anyone globally. Adding to the trust in the data." => "一旦记录发布，任何人，甚至所有者都不能更改记录，全球任何人都只能看到按时间顺序排列的修改记录。 增加对数据的信任。",
  "Open, Public & Transparent" => "公正、公开、透明",
  "Open-source Blockchain maintains a ledger of records in a simple key-value pair. Just query using a key or tx id & verify the record. Check its trail of version & when they got published." => "开源区块链在一个简单的键值对中维护一个记录分类帐。 只需使用密钥查询并验证记录。 检查其版本跟踪和发布时间。", 
  "Start Trusting Your Data With Records keeper Today" => "立即开始使用 Records keeper 信任您的数据",
  "With tools to make every part of your day-to-day work easy, our support team is excited to help you to get started with onboarding the existing scattered data to well-structured easy to find records in safe domestic servers with end-to-end encryption and bank-grade security. Security, Privacy & Transparency, all come together in one place." => "我们的支持团队借助工具让您日常工作的每个部分变得轻松，我们很高兴能帮助您开始将现有的分散数据载入到安全的国内服务器中结构良好且易于查找的记录，并提供端到端的服务。 终端加密和银行级安全性。 安全、隐私和透明度，集为一体。", 
  "GET STARTED" => "开始",
  "Make Data Verifiable without Trusted Third Party" => "使数据在没有可信第三方的情况下可验证", 
  "WSE allows you to create verifiable & immutable records of any types of data that are not possible in traditional technologies like MySQL, Oracle, MSSQL, etc." => "WSE允许您为任何类型的数据创建可验证和不可变的记录，这些数据在MySQL、Oracle、MSSQL等传统技术中是不可能的。",
  "This can also be seen as a tool to generate a Proof-of-Existence, Proof-of-Authenticity & Proof-of-Integrity of a file, record, document, certificate, degree on Blockchain." => "这也可以被视为在区块链上生成文件、记录、文档、证书、学位的存在证明、真实性证明和完整性证明的工具。", 
